<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/19/eng@/~cl_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 53 of the principal act is amended by inserting after the words “reasonable care and skill” the words “and that any material supplied in connection with such services will be fit for the purpose for which it is supplied”. New Part XIA"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/19/eng@/~cl_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/19/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/19/eng@> .
